1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,376
Your money does not grow in a line. It
grows in a curve.

2
00:00:05,926 --> 00:00:10,903
Seven percent a year sounds small. Wait
until you see thirty years.

3
00:00:11,873 --> 00:00:13,364
The curve is the point.

4
00:00:14,914 --> 00:00:20,101
Simple interest pays on what you put in.
Compound pays on what you kept.

5
00:00:21,071 --> 00:00:22,509
That is the whole gap.

6
00:00:24,059 --> 00:00:28,612
First ten years: a little. Next twenty:
some.

7
00:00:29,582 --> 00:00:31,798
Then the last ten years does the work.

8
00:00:32,768 --> 00:00:34,166
Almost all of it.

9
00:00:35,716 --> 00:00:41,684
Start early. Do not withdraw. Two rules,
and no skill required.

10
00:00:42,654 --> 00:00:44,917
And ignore the noise between the two.

11
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:49,778
Ten years early is worth more than ten
years late.

12
00:00:51,328 --> 00:00:55,850
Early, kept, quiet. That is the whole
strategy.

13
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:02,337
The best day to start was ten years ago.
The second best is today.
